#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0699 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: BASETYPE is not present, BNRIND is populated, and BNRIND is not equal to ANRIND where ABLFL is equal to Y for a given value of PARAMCD for a combination of device and subject
#note "BNRIND=NORMAL vs max(ANRIND where ABLFL=Y)=NORMAL -> noViolation"
dataset ADLBC class=MD-BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ABLFL type=Char
col ANRIND type=Char
col BNRIND type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV01 | GLUC | Y | NORMAL | NORMAL
---
